{% comment %}
  Post-download install guide.

  Reached only by clicking a Download button: site.js starts the download from
  the button's href and then sends the visitor here. It is deliberately not in
  the header or footer navigation and it is noindex, so it stays an unlisted
  page rather than a search result.

  The video is served from Shopify Files, not from theme assets, because Shopify
  rejects .mp4 as a theme asset entirely. The URL lives in a theme setting
  (settings.install_video_url) so it can be swapped in the customizer without a
  code change. The poster frame IS a theme asset, since jpg is allowed.

  The written steps are not decoration. They carry the same information for
  anyone who cannot play video, is on a metered connection, or just wants to
  read it, and every one of them is true of the current app.
{% endcomment %}

{{ 'page-legal.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- comment -%} Unlisted: reachable from the download button, not from search. {%- endcomment -%}
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, follow">

{%- assign dl = 'https://github.com/austins041/MizTweakz/releases/latest/download/MizTweakz-Setup.exe' -%}
{%- if settings.download_url != blank -%}{%- assign dl = settings.download_url -%}{%- endif -%}

<section class="banner" data-mount aria-labelledby="install-title">
  <div class="banner-content">
    <span class="title-tag" style="--color:#22c55e">Download started</span>
    <h1 class="banner-title" id="install-title">Video guide: how to install MizTweakz correctly</h1>
    <p class="banner-subtitle">
      Your download is on its way. Watch this before you run it and you will be set up in
      about two minutes. If the download did not start, there is a button for it below.
    </p>
    <div class="banner-pills">
      <span class="title-tag">1 min 36 sec</span>
      <span class="title-tag" style="--color:#3b82f6">Windows 10 &amp; 11</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section animate" aria-labelledby="video-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header section-header--left">
      <span class="title-tag bar-eyebrow" aria-hidden="true">Watch first</span>
      <h2 class="section-title" id="video-title">Installing MizTweakz, start to finish</h2>
    </div>

    {%- if settings.install_video_url != blank -%}
      <div class="install-video-wrap">
        <video
          class="install-video"
          controls
          playsinline
          preload="metadata"
          width="1920" height="1080"
          poster="{{ 'install-guide-poster.jpg' | asset_url }}">
          <source src="{{ settings.install_video_url }}" type="video/mp4">
          Your browser cannot play this video. The written steps below cover the same ground.
        </video>
      </div>
    {%- else -%}
      <div class="legal-layout legal-layout--single">
        <div class="legal-prose">
          <p>
            The video has not been set yet. Add its URL under Online Store, Customize, Theme
            settings, Install guide. The written steps below work regardless.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-with-bar bar-section animate" aria-labelledby="steps-title">
  <span class="title-tag bar-eyebrow" aria-hidden="true">Written version</span>
  <h2 class="section-title" id="steps-title">The same thing in five steps</h2>
  <p class="showcase-subtitle">For when you cannot play the video, or would rather read.</p>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="legal-layout legal-layout--single">
      <div class="legal-prose">
        <ol class="install-steps">
          <li>
            <b>Run MizTweakz-Setup.exe.</b> It is the file that just downloaded, usually in your
            Downloads folder.
          </li>
          <li>
            <b>Allow it when Windows asks for administrator rights.</b> Most tweaks write to the
            registry, Windows services and scheduled tasks, and Windows requires administrator
            rights for all three. The app will ask again each time it launches.
          </li>
          <li>
            <b>Create an account or sign in.</b> The free tier works offline once you are signed
            in. Paid tweak definitions arrive from the server for that session only and are never
            written to disk.
          </li>
          <li>
            <b>Make a restore point before you apply anything.</b> There is a button for it on any
            category header and in the Restore points tool. It takes a moment and means you can
            put the machine back exactly as it was.
          </li>
          <li>
            <b>Apply tweaks one at a time or a whole category at once.</b> Start with the ones
            marked safe. Anything can be reverted individually or by category afterwards.
          </li>
        </ol>
        <p>
          Want to know exactly what each one changes first?
          <a href="/pages/tweaks">All 525 are documented here</a>, and
          <a href="/pages/safe">this page covers safety and anti-cheat</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="final-cta glass-card reveal" aria-labelledby="install-cta-title">
  <div class="cta-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <span class="section-label">Did not start?</span>
  <h2 id="install-cta-title">Download it again</h2>
  <p>Clicking here downloads the installer directly and will not send you back to this page.</p>
  <div class="cta-group">
    <div class="nice-button-box"><a class="nice-button btn-lg" href="{{ dl }}" data-no-guide>Download for <span class="free-word">Free</span></a></div>
    <a class="nice-button grey btn-lg" href="/pages/utilities">See plans</a>
  </div>
</section>

{%- comment -%}
  VideoObject so the guide can surface as a video result. uploadDate is the day
  the file was added; update it if the video is ever replaced.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if settings.install_video_url != blank -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "VideoObject",
  "name": "How to install MizTweakz correctly",
  "description": "A walkthrough of installing the MizTweakz Windows app: running the installer, granting administrator rights, signing in, creating a restore point and applying your first tweaks.",
  "thumbnailUrl": [{{ 'install-guide-poster.jpg' | asset_url | prepend: request.origin | json }}],
  "uploadDate": "2026-09-16",
  "duration": "PT1M36S",
  "contentUrl": {{ settings.install_video_url | json }},
  "publisher": { "@type": "Organization", "name": {{ shop.name | json }} }
}
</script>
{%- endif -%}
